WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.650
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.960
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:09.310
I can't believe Lulu-chan is the culprit behind the ? Egg incidents!

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:11.410
Oh me, oh my!

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.810
I'm sure she has a reason!

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.310
Lulu-chan, we're on your side!

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:18.590
So is Amu-chan of course!

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.450
If you've got problems, she'll fix 'em in a jiffy!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.400
Doki!

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.910
Why y'all 're just...

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.360
I'm gonna tell you a secret.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.270
Don't tell <i>anyone</i>, okay?

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.160
Even though I'm not girly at all,

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.930
two certain boys said they like me!

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.870
Jump up a bit into the sky.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.750
My dearest friends are always there.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.580
Even if you suddenly Character Change,

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.490
I'll be there to stop you with my great big heart.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.360
Pinky swear!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.760
Cross my heart!

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.970
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:22.020
That'd be universal peace, but...

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.770
I'll end up protectin' everyone's hearts.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.540
Let's all smile together!

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:30.400
Lucky, happy, leave it to me!

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.210
That's world peace! Yeah, that!

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.440
Everyone has dreams, so I'm gonna protect 'em!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.260
Make a victory sign together!

00:01:54.550 --> 00:02:00.240
Derya! Dorya! Shrimp tempura!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:05.040
Today, we're gonna take some ? Eggs and find that Embryo!

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:05.690
Huh?

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.810
What was that?

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.220
That's right.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:25.870
I've been the one extracting ? Eggs, in order to obtain the Embryo.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:33.460
Episode 88
Confrontation! The Great ? Egg Calamity!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.960
I don't believe it. It's not true, right?

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.180
You've been using everyone's dreams, Lulu?

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.180
I have.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.280
But... why?

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.650
I'm just making people's dreams come true!

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.940
Nobody asked you to grant them like <i>that</i>!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.230
Perhaps.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:58.320
What will you do with the Embryo if you get it?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.620
Do you have a wish you want granted?

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.760
That's none of your business!

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.570
Just go home, would you!

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:07.700
Lulu...

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.120
Lulu?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.670
What's wrong? I heard you shouting...

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.790
Shush, Maman!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.750
Go home.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.240
Lulu...

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:38.100
Lulu extracted ? Eggs from all those people...

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.900
I thought we were finally getting closer, but now...

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.810
I thought we were finally friends, but all this time...

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.800
Amu-chan...

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:51.040
I'm sure she has a very good reason.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.190
So do I. Lulu is definitely a good person at heart.

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.190
I agree!

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:00.740
She's got a Guardian Character with her, after all!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:07.260
And she did her best to nurse Nana-chan back to health.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:10.420
And she loves her mom and dad, too!

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.840
I can't picture her as a bad guy.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.650
Yeah, I think you're right.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.110
Thanks, everyone.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.450
Lulu and Amu-chan had a fight?

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.420
Yes.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:36.190
I see. So that's why she seemed down when she left.

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.390
Just when she finally had a friend come over...

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.950
I thought things were going well, but...

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:45.770
Don't worry, I'm sure they'll make up soon.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:49.890
And I know Lulu will understand how you feel, too, dear.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.190
Darling...

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:56.380
Lulu, I'm sorry I spilled the beans about the ? Eggs.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:05:00.400
It's fine. We'll be leaving Japan soon anyway.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.700
Lulu?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:11.280
Maman, I'm sorry about before.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.920
Oh, Lulu, it's fine.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:17.200
I'm sure you'll make up with Amu-chan real soon.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.000
Putting that aside... Maman...

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.380
What is it?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.180
When will we be returning to France? When does filming begin?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.100
Oh, you mean for that movie?

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:29.190
I turned it down.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.370
I've got a lot of variety shows lined up,

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.930
so it'd be really difficult for me to return to France.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.730
But...

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:45.360
Lulu, your mom tells me she's going to be on an improv show!  {I think improv will be more easily understood by the audience. Besides, it's clarified in the next line. editor note: "Monomane" is a form of Japanese comedy involving short skits where the performer or performers act like a person, or situation, or animal, or whatever...  It's not exactly "impersonation" because the goal isn't to be accurate, but just to get quick laughs...  It's more like the comedy on "Who's line is it anyway?" although it is not usuall improv}

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.840
Yeah! What kind of skit do you think I should do?

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:49.830
Maman...

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.700
You don't want to be in movies anymore?

00:05:55.820 --> 00:06:00.380
Well, it's not that, exactly. I just enjoy what I'm doing now so much.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:15.740
Why? It was finally her big chance...

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:19.890
Your mama-san said she likes what she's doing now.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.590
There's no way that can be true!

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:25.810
Maman is an A-list actress! There must be another reason!

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:29.290
A reason she was forced to turn down that movie!

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.110
But I don't really think-

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.110
There's darn well gotta be one!

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.910
I've gotta get her back up on that there screen!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:40.580
Are you sure?

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.450
You can't be serious.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:53.950
Lulu-chan, of all people?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:56.470
With her mother, the actress Mayuzumi Kahoru-san...

00:06:56.470 --> 00:07:00.060
And her father, the owner-chef of five star restaurant Maxim de France...

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:03.830
And her viscountess grandmother, and her... and her...

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.780
Yeah, it's her.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.640
I never would have pegged her as the culprit.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.620
A truly shocking revelation-dechu.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.470
What should we do?

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.110
What's going on, guys-nya?

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.220
Well, you see...

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:27.310
Lulu's been extracting ? Eggs?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:31.580
Wait? You guys didn't know?

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:36.970
Lulu was recruited by Easter's French branch to help capture the Embryo-nya.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:41.020
Oops! Did I forget to tell you guys about that?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.560
Sorry, my bad-nya!

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.450
That's enough-nya!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:53.700
What'd... I do...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.320
You kept a secret from us!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:08:00.160
Hiding something from your King is a grave insult!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.210
How could you keep such an important fact from us?

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.840
Nobody asked-nya!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.130
So what do we do now?

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:13.280
We have to stop her from extracting ? Eggs from anyone else.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:16.760
Do you think she'll stop if we say please?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.530
I highly doubt it.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.870
But she's our friend...

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.970
And you can't sit back and watch while your friend's doing bad things.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.860
Lulu's being used by Easter,

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.970
and she's letting them because she has a dream she wants to fulfill.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.340
That has to be it!

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.930
I don't know what Lulu's dream is, exactly,

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:38.770
but I'll still tell her I'm behind her, and that she should stop this.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:40.370
Amu-chi...

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.830
Once school's out, let's all head over to Yamamoto-san's house.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.810
Who's Yamamoto-san?

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:52.190
Lulu de Morcerf Yamamoto.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.760
Oh, I see.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.050
Tadase-kun...

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:02.280
Yeah. I'm sure she'll understand how you feel, Amu-chan.

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:07.270
And since I'm friends with Lulu-chi, too, I'm coming!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.590
Even though you forgot her last name?

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:11.680
Whatever!

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:29.790
Lulu, are you feeling all right?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:30.730
Yeah...

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.620
I contacted the school.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:38.440
I'm going to head to work now, so please rest quietly for the day.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.690
Okay. Have a nice day.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:50.230
Should you be lying to your mama-san?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.070
If I do this right, it won't be a problem.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.690
But...

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.670
This time, I'm going to catch the Embryo. Just you watch.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:09.200
Hey! I'm thirsty, too-nya!

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.250
Maybe we should let him down from there.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.760
Ignore him. Leave him be.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.130
Am I, uh, interrupting?

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.340
Nana-tan!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.830
I brought somethin' for y'all...

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.230
Here you go.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.690
Thank you.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.200
What is going on here?

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.950
You're the enemy!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:43.720
We heard about how your bearer is the person extracting ? Eggs!

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:46.070
Kiseki, listen to what she has to say-dechu!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.210
Is it about Lulu-chan?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:55.920
It's not like Lulu's tryin' to catch the Embryo because she wants to be bad or anything...

00:10:56.640 --> 00:11:01.460
Lulu just wants to make a certain person happy.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.940
It's someone she loves a whole lot,

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:08.430
so she's been workin' her heart out tryin' to find that Embryo.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.350
A certain person?

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:16.670
I... I just love my little Lulu so much...

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.640
All I wanna do is help her out!

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.200
I just wanna be helpin' her!

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:28.630
We understand, Nana.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:29.330
Yes.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:33.120
We love Amu-chan, too.

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:36.300
And I'm helping Yaya-tan make her dream come true-dechu!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.620
Same here! I'm definitely gonna find you, Ikuto-nya!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:45.030
But I just dunno what's what anymore...

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:50.680
Is Lulu's wish for that person what {i\1}they want?

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:54.360
Or is it just what Lulu wants, herself?

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:57.610
I'm so confused...

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.530
Nana-chan.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.530
You already know the answer.

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.250
Dia!

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:28.260
Long time no see, everyone.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:32.410
Dia! Um, well, you see, we've got a big problem!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:37.990
Don't worry, I'm sure Dia-tan heard everything from inside her egg.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.270
You really know the answer, don't you, Nana-chan?

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:46.350
No, I don't know anything anymore...

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:48.620
Not true. You know more than you think.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.000
You know what Lulu-chan's true dream is; her true wish.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:58.630
After all, you're who Lulu-chan wants to be.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.630
Who she wants to be?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:12.540
A pastry chef? Oh! Being a flower lady would be nice, too!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.100
Or maybe I should run a shoe store?

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:17.600
I want to do them all!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:30.170
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:32.130
Nice to meetcha, Lulu!

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:39.240
What should we do next, Lulu?

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:43.860
Tennis? Horseback riding? How about rock climbing?

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:46.040
None of the above, frankly.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:47.680
Lulu?

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.400
Grandmother.

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.610
Reading again?

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.540
Teaching yourself how to make jewelry, are you?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.430
No, I am simply reading about it.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:02.710
As you so diligently instructed, Grandmother, I am striving to become a perfect person.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:06.700
At present, it is sufficient for me to help my mother around the house.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.280
I haven't the time to spare for other activities.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.990
Not that "perfect" idea again...

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.920
Ain't it enough to relax and have some fun?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:22.380
It is time to study right now, so if you'll excuse me.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.920
Lulu!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:34.400
Lulu's dream?

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:36.100
Everyone!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:40.900
Come, gather 'round! I'll grant your every wish!

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:41.770
Lulu...

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:46.130
Worried about love? School? Let me take care of all your problems!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:50.330
This magic jewelry is the solution!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.990
And right now, we're giving them out for free!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.800
She mentioned love!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.430
You think she's legit?

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.470
I <i>do</i> have a test tomorrow...

00:14:58.470 --> 00:14:59.740
Sounds pretty interesting!

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:01.110
May I have one?

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:04.150
Here you go!

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:05.910
Get them before they're gone!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.800
Here's one for you, too.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:10.910
Lulu!

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.070
Nana, where have you been?

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.990
Never mind. What are y'all doin'?

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:17.410
What does it look like?

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:21.310
I'm going to extract a ton of ? Eggs and call out that Embryo.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:24.890
But that's... You can't do that!

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.290
I have to for Maman!

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.610
Lulu...

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.650
Lulu is...

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.390
That's right.

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:37.370
So Lulu-chan was trying to capture the Embryo to make a certain person happy?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.820
Who is it?

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.710
She didn't tell us that...

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:58.410
Guess I've got one left over.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:15:59.770
Well, no matter.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.700
Lulu, maybe it'd be better to stop now...

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:05.670
No, watch this.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:10.650
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:35.960
This feeling...

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:37.420
It's a ? Egg!

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:37.950
Lulu?

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:40.810
But it feels different than usual.

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:41.900
It's like...

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.590
...scarier than normal.

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:45.880
Scarier?

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.270
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.230
Right.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:57.420
Get out here, Embryo.

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.870
Lulu!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.370
Hinamori Amu.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:05.200
Lulu, stop this already! It's not right!

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:09.920
Quiet! I must get the Embryo at all costs!

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:16.920
Lulu!

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.460
Amu-chan, Character Transform!

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.540
But...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:22.110
At this rate, we'll be done for!

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.740
Weren't you going to tell Lulu-chan how you really feel?

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.360
You can do it!

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.810
Amu-chan!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.620
My heart:

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.230
My heart:

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:37.760
My heart:

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.700
My heart:

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.450
Unlock!

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.960
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:58.310
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.820
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.930
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:12.870
You may have Character Transformed, but today of all days I won't let you interfere!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.760
These are...

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:29.850
The dreams from the eggs that were extracted!

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:32.910
Amu, leave them to us!

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:33.550
Right!

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:45.550
We won't let you get in Amu-chi's way!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.060
Holy Crown!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.570
The dream of a kid who likes candy?

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.430
Lemme at it!

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:04.990
Yummy!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.690
Bala-balance!

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:19.850
I see. You must belong to a child who loves comedy.

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.790
But that doesn't make me laugh one bit.

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:27.070
Juggling Party!

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:32.590
You lack discipline.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:34.110
Start again from the top.

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:40.350
Why won't the Embryo come out?

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:41.480
Lulu!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.920
Enough already.

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.870
Quiet! This has nothing to do with you!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.140
Lulu...

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:52.580
I heard you're trying to capture the Embryo for someone important to you.

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:55.840
Nana told us!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:56.880
Nana?

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:01.260
Please don't be angry at her!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:05.210
Yeah! Nana was just worried about you, Lulu!

00:20:05.210 --> 00:20:10.240
Tell me why. Who on Earth are you trying to capture the Embryo for?

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:13.870
It's her mama-san!

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:14.690
Nana!

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:17.910
Lulu's just thinking of her mama-san!

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:21.480
Lulu's... Lulu's not a bad person!

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.160
For your mom?

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:27.130
That's right, to help her.

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:31.560
So I can restore my mother to her rightful place as an A-list actress!

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.410
Why?

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:36.780
Isn't it obvious? To make her happy!

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:41.420
My mother is too good for those variety shows! She must hate doing them!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:47.730
Really? Did she tell you that?

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:53.620
No, but it's obvious. She shone brightest back when she was an actress!

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:54.810
Are you sure?

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:59.490
I don't know what things were like in the past...

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:04.740
But I think your mom shines bright enough right now.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:09.160
Whenever she's with you, your mom's totally beaming.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:12.870
If you go through with this, your mother won't be happy about it.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:18.550
No. In fact, if she knew you were manipulating people's dreams, I'm sure she'd be sad!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.760
True, she wouldn't like it.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.380
But for her...

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:34.820
Nana...

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:38.560
Forgive me...

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:41.480
Lulu...

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:44.650
What's happening?

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:49.870
Lulu!

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.350
Lulu!

00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:57.710
Nana-chan!

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:36.410
Maybe I was wrong to pretend not to notice your worries.

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:41.220
It's okay if you can't tell me everything.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:43.600
With that dark look on your face,

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.840
go ahead and scream dark things.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:50.150
You shouldn't leave all those heavy feelings inside.

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:51.630
Ride On!

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:57.830
If you don't... If it's like that...

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:00.750
You couldn't tell me if you wanted to, huh?

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:04.500
I get it.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:07.160
I'm sure your circumstances will change one day.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:10.190
That time will come! That time is now!

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:15.820
Don't you want to have someone

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:18.450
say congratulations to you once in your life?

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:23.380
Doesn't the breeze feel nice today?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:27.750
Even if you feel like it's all you can do to survive...

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:32.620
You can make your life into something you enjoy. It's so nice!

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:37.440
"Everything's for you."

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:42.040
How about that?

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:45.190
My boy!

00:23:50.560 --> 00:23:53.760
What are we going to do, Amu-chan? Things have gone from bad to worse!

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:56.610
She's even undergone a ? Character Transformation!

00:23:56.610 --> 00:23:58.120
What will happen now?

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:01.530
It'll be okay. Even if she ? Character Transformed, Lulu is still our friend.

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:02.460
Amu-chan...

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:05.920
That's true. And so is Nana!

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:09.300
Let's all work together to save them both!

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:10.380
Yeah!

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:12.580
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.580 --> 00:24:14.660
Heart to Heart.

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:19.040
Lulu, Nana, I'm going to save both of your hearts!
